---
layout: layouts/enterprise.njk
navActive: industries
title: "Cybersecurity Solutions for Manufacturing Industry"
description: "Secure manufacturing operations with cybersecurity services covering OT security assessments, penetration testing, vulnerability management and industrial network security to reduce cyber risks."
crumbs: [["Home", "/"], ["Industries", "/industries/"], ["Manufacturing"]]
---
{% from "partials/enterprise/macros.njk" import arrow %}
{% from "partials/enterprise/icons.njk" import icon %}
{%- set faqs = [
  ["Why is cybersecurity important for the manufacturing industry?", "Cybersecurity helps manufacturers reduce the risk of production downtime and ransomware attacks while protecting intellectual property and sensitive business data. It also helps identify weaknesses in connected machinery and industrial control systems before attackers exploit them."],
  ["What manufacturing cybersecurity services does CipherTrivia provide?", "CipherTrivia provides manufacturing penetration testing and vulnerability assessments alongside industrial network security reviews and OT/ICS assessments as well as web application and API testing or cloud security assessments."],
  ["Do you provide cybersecurity testing for SCADA and PLC systems?", "Yes. Assessments can cover supervisory control and data acquisition (SCADA) systems and programmable logic controllers (PLCs), subject to the agreed scope and operational safety requirements."],
  ["How much do manufacturing cybersecurity services cost?", "The cost depends on the number of assets being assessed and the complexity of the industrial environment as well as the testing depth and reporting requirements. CipherTrivia can provide a quotation after reviewing your infrastructure and security objectives."],
  ["Will cybersecurity testing interrupt manufacturing operations?", "Testing is planned around production requirements and system sensitivity. Industrial control systems may require passive assessment methods or controlled testing windows to minimize the risk of operational disruption."],
  ["How long does a manufacturing cybersecurity assessment take?", "The timeline depends on the number of systems in scope and the complexity of the manufacturing environment. A focused assessment may take several days while larger environments with multiple production sites may require several weeks."],
  ["How do you identify vulnerabilities in manufacturing networks?", "We examine network architecture and segmentation alongside exposed services and access controls or software vulnerabilities. Testing helps identify potential attack paths between enterprise IT systems and operational technology environments."],
  ["Can you assess legacy manufacturing systems that cannot be updated easily?", "Yes. We can assess legacy systems using methods appropriate to their technical limitations and operational sensitivity, helping manufacturers identify security risks and prioritize practical mitigation measures."],
  ["Which cybersecurity standards are relevant to manufacturing companies?", "Relevant standards and frameworks may include IEC 62443 for industrial automation security and ISO/IEC 27001 for information security management or the NIST Cybersecurity Framework for cybersecurity risk management. Applicable requirements depend on the organization's operations and industry obligations."],
  ["Do you provide a report with remediation recommendations?", "Yes. CipherTrivia provides a security assessment report outlining identified vulnerabilities and their severity alongside technical evidence and prioritized remediation recommendations."],
  ["Can you retest vulnerabilities after remediation?", "Yes. We can retest identified vulnerabilities within the agreed scope to verify that fixes have addressed the reported issues and highlight any remaining security gaps."],
  ["How can we get started with CipherTrivia's manufacturing cybersecurity services?", "Contact CipherTrivia with details about your production systems and industrial network architecture alongside your security objectives. Our team can review the requirements and recommend a suitable assessment scope with a proposed timeline and quotation."]
] %}
{#- Challenges: icon + its node position on the attack-surface map (clockwise from top left) -#}
{%- set challenges = [
  ["chip", "12%", "12%", 48, 48, "Industrial Control System (ICS) Vulnerabilities", "Legacy PLCs, SCADA systems and industrial control equipment often run outdated software, making them vulnerable to cyberattacks that can disrupt production processes."],
  ["lock", "50%", "12%", 200, 48, "Ransomware and Production Downtime", "Ransomware attacks can lock critical systems and encrypt operational data, resulting in halted production lines, delayed deliveries and financial losses."],
  ["lateral", "88%", "12%", 352, 48, "IT and OT Network Exposure", "Connecting operational technology (OT) with information technology (IT) increases the risk of attackers moving from corporate networks into factory systems."],
  ["update", "88%", "37.25%", 352, 149, "Legacy Systems and Unpatched Software", "Older machinery and unsupported operating systems may lack current security updates, leaving exploitable vulnerabilities across manufacturing environments."],
  ["dependency", "88%", "62.75%", 352, 251, "Supply Chain Cyber Risks", "Third-party vendors and connected suppliers can introduce security weaknesses through compromised software, remote access connections or insecure integrations."],
  ["document", "88%", "88%", 352, 352, "Intellectual Property Theft", "Manufacturing companies hold valuable CAD files, product designs, engineering data and proprietary production processes that attackers may target for industrial espionage."],
  ["wifi", "50%", "88%", 200, 352, "Insecure Industrial IoT Devices", "Connected sensors, smart machines and remote monitoring devices can expose factory networks when they use weak authentication or insecure communication protocols."],
  ["users-cross", "12%", "88%", 48, 352, "Insider Threats and Access Misuse", "Employees and contractors with excessive permissions may accidentally expose confidential information or misuse access to critical production systems."],
  ["eye-off", "12%", "62.75%", 48, 251, "Limited OT Security Monitoring", "Traditional security tools may not provide sufficient visibility into industrial protocols and factory equipment, allowing suspicious activity to go undetected."],
  ["clipboard", "12%", "37.25%", 48, 149, "Regulatory Compliance and Safety Risks", "Manufacturers must address applicable cybersecurity requirements alongside operational safety standards, particularly when attacks could affect equipment reliability or worker safety."]
] %}
{#- Services: icon, matching service page (empty when there is no dedicated page), title, text -#}
{%- set services = [
  ["target", "/services/penetration-testing/", "Manufacturing Penetration Testing", "We simulate realistic attack scenarios against manufacturing applications and network infrastructure to uncover exploitable vulnerabilities that could expose production data or compromise critical business systems."],
  ["network", "/services/network-security-testing/", "Industrial Network Security Assessment", "Our assessments examine factory networks and communication pathways to identify insecure configurations and weak network segmentation or unauthorized access points that could expose industrial operations to cyber threats."],
  ["gear", "", "OT and ICS Security Assessment", "We evaluate operational technology (OT) environments and industrial control systems (ICS) to identify security weaknesses in industrial configurations and access controls or connections between business networks and production equipment."],
  ["magnifier", "/services/vapt-security-services/", "Manufacturing Vulnerability Assessment", "We identify known vulnerabilities and outdated software or insecure configurations across manufacturing infrastructure, helping security teams prioritize remediation according to severity and potential operational impact."],
  ["browser", "/services/web-application-security-testing/", "Web Application and API Security Testing", "We test manufacturing portals and production management applications alongside APIs and supplier-facing platforms to uncover authentication flaws and broken access controls or data exposure risks."],
  ["cloud-lock", "/services/cloud-security-services/", "Manufacturing Cloud Security Assessment", "We review cloud-hosted manufacturing applications and storage environments for misconfigured resources and excessive permissions or exposed services that could compromise operational data and business applications."],
  ["wifi", "", "Industrial IoT and Connected Device Security Testing", "We assess connected sensors and smart manufacturing devices for weak authentication and insecure communications or exposed interfaces that could provide attackers with access to industrial networks."],
  ["key", "", "Remote Access and Access Control Assessment", "We examine remote maintenance solutions and privileged accounts alongside vendor access mechanisms to identify excessive permissions and weak authentication controls that could expose critical manufacturing systems."],
  ["doc-check", "/services/security-compliance/", "Manufacturing Security Compliance Assessment", "We evaluate relevant security controls against applicable standards and frameworks, including ISO 27001 and the NIST Cybersecurity Framework, helping manufacturers identify control gaps and prioritize improvements."],
  ["agent", "/ai-security/", "AI and Smart Factory Security Testing", "We assess AI-powered manufacturing applications and intelligent agents for risks involving sensitive data exposure and excessive permissions or insecure integrations with production systems and connected industrial platforms."],
  ["retest", "", "Security Retesting and Remediation Validation", "After vulnerabilities are addressed, we retest affected systems within the agreed scope to verify remediation and identify remaining weaknesses that may require additional attention."]
] %}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Service",
      "name": "Cybersecurity Solutions for Manufacturing",
      "serviceType": "Cybersecurity Services",
      "description": "Secure manufacturing operations with cybersecurity services covering OT security assessments, penetration testing, vulnerability management and industrial network security to reduce cyber risks.",
      "url": "https://www.ciphertrivia.com/industries/manufacturing/",
      "areaServed": "Worldwide",
      "audience": { "@type": "BusinessAudience", "audienceType": "Manufacturing businesses" },
      "provider": { "@id": "https://www.ciphertrivia.com/#organization" },
      "hasOfferCatalog": {
        "@type": "OfferCatalog",
        "name": "Cybersecurity Services for Manufacturing and Industrial Environments",
        "itemListElement": [
          {%- for s in services %}
          { "@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": { "@type": "Service", "name": {{ s[2] | dump | safe }} } }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
          {%- endfor %}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.ciphertrivia.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Industries", "item": "https://www.ciphertrivia.com/industries/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Manufacturing" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {%- for q in faqs %}
        { "@type": "Question", "name": {{ q[0] | dump | safe }}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ q[1] | dump | safe }} } }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>

