<section class="ind-hero ind-hero--blueprint" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="guides" aria-hidden="true"><div class="container"></div></div>

  <div class="container ind-hero__inner">
    <div class="ind-hero__copy">
      <h1 class="ind-hero__title rv" id="hero-title">Cybersecurity Solutions for <span class="accent">Manufacturing</span></h1>
      <p class="ind-hero__lede rv" style="--d:1">Manufacturing environments face growing cyber risks as connected machinery and industrial control systems become increasingly integrated with enterprise IT networks. A single vulnerability can expose production systems to ransomware and unauthorized access or operational disruption. CipherTrivia delivers manufacturing cybersecurity services that identify security weaknesses across industrial networks and applications alongside OT environments and connected infrastructure. Through penetration testing and vulnerability assessments or industrial security reviews, we help manufacturers reduce cyber risks and safeguard production continuity across their digital operations.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions rv" style="--d:2">
        <a class="btn btn--signal" href="/contact/">Talk to Our Security Experts {{ arrow() }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ind-hero__media">
    <img class="ind-hero__img" style="object-position: 50% 50%" src="/assets/industries/manufacturing.webp" srcset="/assets/industries/manufacturing-960.webp 960w, /assets/industries/manufacturing.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1920" height="1080" alt="Automated production floor with injection-moulding machines and robotic arms" fetchpriority="high">
    <span class="motif motif--ruler" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="motif motif--gear" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("gear", "lg") }}</span>
  </div>
</section>

