<section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="s2-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="ihead">
      <h2 class="ihead__title rv" id="s2-title">Cybersecurity Services for Manufacturing and Industrial Environments</h2>
      <div class="ihead__lede rv" style="--d:1">
        <p>Manufacturing environments require specialized security testing across production equipment and industrial control systems alongside enterprise applications and connected factory networks. CipherTrivia provides manufacturing cybersecurity services that identify exploitable vulnerabilities and assess security risks across IT infrastructure and operational technology (OT).</p>
        <p>CipherTrivia's cybersecurity solutions for manufacturing focus on actionable findings and practical remediation guidance. By evaluating technical vulnerabilities alongside their potential impact on production and business operations, we help manufacturers make informed security decisions and reduce exposure across connected industrial environments.</p>
      </div>
